                  Parameters for DSSIM
                  ********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
1                             - conditional simulation (1=yes, 0=no)
data.dat                      - file with conditioning data
1  2  0  3  0  0              -  columns for X,Y,Z,vr,wt,sec.var.
-1.0       1.0e21             -  trimming limits for conditioning data
0                             -debugging level: 0,1,2,3
dssim.dbg                     -file for debugging output
dssim.out                     -file for output
1                             -number of realizations to generate
2                             -ccdf. type: 0-unif, 1-lognorm, 2-bootstrap
data.dat                      - bootstrap file
3    0                        - columns for variable and weights
50    0.5    1.0              -nx,xmn,xsiz
50    0.5    1.0              -ny,ymn,ysiz
1     0.5    1.0              -nz,zmn,zsiz
69069                         -random number seed
0     8                       -min and max original data for sim
12                            -number of simulated nodes to use
1                             -assign data to nodes (0=no, 1=yes)
1     3                       -multiple grid search (0=no, 1=yes),num
0                             -maximum data per octant (0=not used)
20.0  20.0  20.0              -maximum search radii (hmax,hmin,vert)
 0.0   0.0   0.0              -angles for search ellipsoid
0                             -ktype: 0=SK,1=OK,2=LVM,3=EXDR,4=COLC
5.0     9.0                   - global mean and variance
ydata.dat                     -  file with LVM, EXDR, or COLC variable
4                             -  column for secondary variable
1    0.2                      -nst, nugget effect
1    0.8  0.0   0.0   0.0     -it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
         10.0  10.0  10.0     -a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
1                             -trans 1=yes,0=no
data.dat                      -  file with target histogram
3   0                         -  columns for variable and weight(0=none)
0      20.                    - zmin,zmax (tail extrapolation for trans)
1      0.0                    -  lower tail option, parameter
1      20.0                   -  upper tail option, parameter
0                             -if conditional,read or calc. est. var.(1=r,0=c)
kt3d.out                      -file with estimation variance
2                             -column number for estimation variance
0.33                          -control parameter ( 0.33 < w < 3.0 )
0.5                           -added local accuracy
